		 <ul><li>from 1974 to 1981 the matches were played best of 3 (games to 21)
		 <li>from 1981 to Dec 2017 the games were played best of 5 (games to 11) win by one for a time, then eventually win by two for all games.
		 <li>There were a few tourneys between Oct 1981 and 1988 that played some matches via amateur rules for various reasons.  This is how there are a few 
		     two-game scores during best 3 of 5 game formats.
		 <li>since Jan 2018 they play conventional scoring; best of 3 (games to 15).  
		 </ul>
		 <p> The stats below are divided by scoring system and do not conflate the 'old' best-of-3 scoring with the 'new' best of 3 scoring unless noted.<p>";
      }
      elsif ($form{'tour'} eq 'LPRT') {
         printf "The LPRT has had several scoring systems through it its history: <br>
